+## Error Handling
+
+### Common Error Cases
+
+1. **No Command**: "No command received"
+2. **Invalid Command**: No output (command is ignored)
+3. **Too Many Arguments**: Extra arguments are ignored
+4. **Too Many Callbacks**: "Error: Too many callbacks registered"
